#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:2
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "组织"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:6
msgid ""
"In this article, we explain how the *organizations* feature allows you to "
"manage access to your projects. On |com_brand|, your account is linked to an"
" *organization*. Organizations allow you to define both individual and team "
"permissions for your projects."
msgstr "本文讲解*组织* 功能如何让你管理项目的访问权限。在 |com_brand| 上，你的账户关联到一个*组织* 。组织让你能为项目定义个人和团队两种权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:13
msgid "A step-by-step guide to managing organization owners and teams."
msgstr "管理组织所有者和团队的分步指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:16
msgid "Important objects"
msgstr "重要对象"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Owners** -- Get full access to both view and edit the organization and all"
" projects"
msgstr "**所有者** -- 对组织和所有项目拥有查看和编辑的完全权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:19
msgid "**Members** -- Get access to a subset of the organization projects"
msgstr "**成员** -- 可访问组织中部分项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:20
msgid "**Teams** -- Where you give members access to a set of projects."
msgstr "**团队** -- 在此为成员授予一组项目的访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:22
msgid "The best way to think about this relationship is:"
msgstr "理解这一关系的最佳方式是："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:24
msgid "*Owners* will create *Teams* to assign permissions to all *Members*."
msgstr "*所有者* 创建*团队* ，为所有*成员* 分配权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:28
msgid ""
"Owners, Members, and Teams behave differently if you are using "
":ref:`sso_git_provider`."
msgstr "若你使用 :ref:`sso_git_provider` ，所有者、成员和团队的行为会有所不同。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:32
msgid "Team types"
msgstr "团队类型"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:34
msgid "You can create two types of teams:"
msgstr "你可以创建两种类型的团队："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Admin** -- Team members have full access to administer the projects "
"assigned to the team. Members are allowed to change all of the settings, set"
" notifications, and perform any action under the :menuselection:`Settings` "
"tab for each project."
msgstr ""
"**管理员** -- 团队成员拥有管理分配给该团队项目的完全权限。成员可以修改所有设置、设置通知，并执行各项目 "
":menuselection:`Settings` 标签页下的任意操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Read Only** -- Team members are only able to read the documentation of "
"each project, and not able to change anything about each project."
msgstr "**只读** -- 团队成员只能阅读各项目的文档，无法对项目做任何更改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:40
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:42
msgid ""
"ACME would set up *Owners* of their organization, for example, Frank "
"Roadrunner would be an owner. He has full access to the organization and all"
" projects."
msgstr "ACME 会为其组织设置*所有者* ，例如 Frank Roadrunner 就是一位所有者。他对组织和所有项目拥有完全权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:46
msgid ""
"Wile E. Coyote is a contractor, and will just have access to the new project"
" Road Builder."
msgstr "Wile E. Coyote 是承包商，将只拥有新项目 Road Builder 的访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/organizations.rst:49
msgid ""
"Roadrunner would set up a *Team* called *Contractors*. That team would have "
"*Read Only* access to the *Road Builder* project. Then he would add *Wile E."
" Coyote* to the team. This would give him access to just this one project "
"inside the organization."
msgstr ""
"Roadrunner 会建立一个名为 *Contractors* 的* 团队*。该团队对 *Road Builder* 项目拥有* 只读*权限。随后他将"
" *Wile E. Coyote* 加入该团队，这使他在组织内仅能访问这一个项目。"

